{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19103230","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19103230","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1910323001:0":{"text":"地上的珊瑚粉末中仍隐隐流动着微弱的光辉。你怀揣着希望，...","source_cn":"地上的珊瑚粉末中仍隐隐流动着微弱的光辉。你怀揣着希望，...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1910323002:0":{"text":"遗憾的是，你几乎无法探测到任何魔法波动。这枝子瑚的损坏...","source_cn":"遗憾的是，你几乎无法探测到任何魔法波动。这枝子瑚的损坏...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910323003:0":{"text":"子瑚……难道修不好了？","source_cn":"子瑚……难道修不好了？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x4BF65E4ADA8F8365","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910323004:0":{"text":"不、不会的……<style=stress><playe...","source_cn":"不、不会的……<style=stress><playe...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:6:1910323005:0":{"text":"艾菲拉转身向繁育池的方向飞速跑去。不一会，各大家族代表...","source_cn":"艾菲拉转身向繁育池的方向飞速跑去。不一会，各大家族代表...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":