瑚，而是能量的凝聚。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x07C7C56FBC072E87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910323012:1":{"text":"只要注入足够的能量，它就能恢复如初。","source_cn":"只要注入足够的能量，它就能恢复如初。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x6E8E2C657F32A73D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1910323012":{"text":"只要注入足够的能量，它就能恢复如初。","source_cn":"只要注入足够的能量，它就能恢复如初。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x6E8E2C657F32A73D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910323013:1":{"text":"是的，亲爱的孩子。但只要我们齐心协力，就能够做到。","source_cn":"是的，亲爱的孩子。但只要我们齐心协力，就能够做到。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x49F5384453071A24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1910323014:1":{"text":"即便是最柔软的水流，汇聚在一处时，亦能化作足以撼动礁岸...","source_cn":"即便是最柔软的水流，汇聚在一处时，亦能化作足以撼动礁岸...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1910323015:1":{"text":"来吧，家人们。为保护我们的家园，贡献出自己的一份力量。","source_cn":"来吧，家人们。为保护我们的家园，贡献出自己的一份力量。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xBFFE8EC9A98F3AE2","variant_statu